<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.fleet.offers ~ the root holder's offer: the face, its root key, a nonce, its scopes

`lares fleet join offer` runs on the root holder: it names the face (`--face N`, else the one face standing open, else a refusal listing them), its root key, a nonce and the scopes the face stands at, and writes the offer (`--out`) or prints it. The courier carries it to the joining vessel, which mints first.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ offer · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`offer` params=`out/offer.json ~ write the offer for the courier`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`face` params=`face/1 out/offer.json ~ offer face 1's fleet`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · out

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ which of the root holder's faces the join serves; absent, the one face standing open`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the file the next vessel reads; absent, print it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ the root holder's act rides the store door under the face's root`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ face-malformed · face-absent · root-absent · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.fleet.offers face/1]] ~ --face names a persona index, a whole number from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-absent` params=`~ this vessel holds no face at that index`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-absent` params=`~ this vessel holds no PersonaGroup root`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the offer refused by name (FleetJoinRefused, a store door refusal, or StoreHeld); the line names the code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ offered · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`offered` params=`exit/0 ~ the offer, written or printed`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

