!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares fleet join offer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares fleet join offer]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

